        "answer": {
          "short": "$86$",
          "worked": "There are $8+18+11+3=40$ values. The middle values are the 20th and 21st values. Both are $86$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{86+86}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=86\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
